    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i>Roaring Twenties</i> of New York City has plunged into darkness, with terrifying creatures overtaking a once-beautiful cityscape. Complete objectives, find clues and hunt down sinister Bounties that offer coveted Blood Diamond Rewards should you successfully extract. But be warned- Its every man, or team, for themselves... And you aren't the only team trying to take back the 'City. <strong>Hunt or Be Hunted!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i>Roaring Twenties</i> of New York City has plunged into darkness, with terrifying creatures overtaking a once-beautiful cityscape. Complete objectives, find clues and hunt down sinister Bounties that offer coveted Blood Diamond Rewards should you successfully extract. But be warned- Its every man, or team, for themselves... And you aren't the only team trying to take back the 'City. <strong>Hunt or Be Hunted!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "An extraction horror PvE and PvP set in 1920's New York City! Team up with up to two others, or go in alone, and search creature-filled semi open-world map for arcane clues that lead you to a lucrative Bounty. Featuring permadeath consequences, only the best hunters will make it out alive..",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
